;CRYSTALS ARE TWINNED BY HEMI-MEROHEDRY SUCH THAT (H,K,L)
REFLECTIONS FROM ONE LATTICE AND (H,K,-H-L) REFLECTIONS
FROM THE OTHER LATTICE ARE SPATIALLY OVERLAPPED.  TWIN
FRACTION FOR CRYSTAL WHOSE DATA THE MODEL WAS REFINED
AGAINST WAS ESTIMATED AT 43%.

THE FOLLOWING REGIONS OF THE HEAVY CHAINS (B AND D) WERE
INCLUDED IN THE MODEL BUT HAVE POORLY DEFINED ELECTRON
DENSITY: 25 - 31, 53 - 56, AND 127 - 137.
;
